Operation <=Greenlight=> Interception Mission III

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_PIN_GAME_3_desc]
To stop the Equestria Empire’s §YOperation <=Greenlight=> §!, we need to find out what the Ponyville Plush Toy Company knows.
We have obtained item §YPonyville Plush Toy Subsidiary Site Selection Region Code List§! and now we need to figure out their real “site selection” plan.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_PIN_GAME_3]
「绿灯」行动拦截任务III

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_PIN_GAME_3_desc]
想要阻止小马利亚帝国的§Y「绿灯」行动§!，我们需要搞清楚毛绒玩具公司到底知道些什么。
我们已经获得了物品§Y小马谷毛绒玩具分公司区域选址代码表§!，接下来我们要搞清楚他们真正的“选址”计划。
